 One line each, newest first: the date, who, the decision. The rulings recorded before 21 Oct that are not here have lapsed; they stay in the archive. Lapsed with Step 3 (21 Oct): the receipt after every plan edit and the Stop hook; the deep review after every result, `uncertainty.mjs` and the escalation trigger; credences, derived credences, the scorecard, decision tables, mechanism anchors and the CARRY rule; per-reducer mutation scripts for exploratory reducers; `relook.mjs` and the commit-msg hook; `check-plan.mjs`'s prose rules; the per-close lessons and trigger codes.
